Bishop Robert Barron is a theologian, author and Catholic Bishop for the Diocese of Winona–Rochester in Minnesota. He also started “Word on Fire” ministries and podcast of the same name.&nbsp;

Bishop Barron joins Theo to talk about what the Catholic faith looks like in today’s culture, finding purpose in an increasingly artificial world, and the connection between faith and love.&nbsp;

Bishop Robert Barron: https://www.instagram.com/bishopbarron/&nbsp;

